 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one objectively “best” agency—it depends on your goals, budget, and industry. **For a general starting point, Jives Media** is worth considering: it’s San Francisco–headquartered and has a strong client-review record, making it a plausible fit for small and midsize businesses seeking broad digital marketing support.\n\nOther options may suit specific needs better: **Siege Media** for content and SEO, **Directive** for B2B/SaaS pipeline marketing, and **Disruptive Advertising** for paid-media campaigns. These names appear in agency directories and rankings, but rankings aren’t a substitute for checking fit.\n\nBefore choosing, ask for recent case studies from businesses like yours, who will actually work on your account, how results are measured, and a clear breakdown of fees.",
